{title: 225 - God Is Working His Purpose Out}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Jesus Christ}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Fm]God is working His purpose [Ab]out
[Fm]As year [Eb]suceeds [Fm/C]to [Eb]year;
[Db/Ab]God is [Fm]working His purpose out,
[Fm]And [Cm/G]the [Ab]time [Cm/G]is [Fm]drawing near;
[Ab]Nearer [Cm]and nearer draws the [Eb]time,
[Cm]The [Bbm]time [Gdim]that [Fm]shall [Gdim]surely [Eb/Bb]be
[Cm]When [Fm]the [Cm]earth shall [D]be [C]filled [Dm]with [Em]the [Fm]glory [Ab]of [Bbm]God
[Cm/Eb]As [Eb7/Db]the [Fm/C]waters [Eb/Bb]cover [Gdim]the [Fm]sea.

Verse 2:
[Fm]From utmost east to utmost [Ab]west,
[Fm]Where'er [Eb]man's [Fm/C]foot hath [Eb]trod,
[Db/Ab]By the [Fm]mouth of many messengers
[Fm]Goes [Cm/G]forth the voice [Eb]of [Fm/C]God;
[Ab]Give ear [Cm]to me, ye confinents,
[Cm]Ye [Bbm]isles, [Fm]give ear to [Eb/Bb]me,
[Cm]That [Fm]the [Cm]earth shall [D]be [C]filled [Dm]with [Em]the [Fm]glory [Ab]of [Bbm]God
[Cm/Eb]As [Eb7/Db]the [Fm/C]waters [Eb/Bb]cover [Gdim]the [Fm]sea.

Verse 3:
[Fm]March we forth in the strength [Cm/G]of [Ab]God
[Fm]With the [Eb]banner [Fm/C]of Christ [Eb]unfurled,
[Db/Ab]That the [Fm]light of the glorious gospel of truth
[Fm]May [Cm/G]shine throughout [Eb]the [Fm/C]world:
[Ab]Fight we [Cm]the fight with sorrow and [Eb]sin
[Cm]To [Bbm]set [Gdim]their [Fm]captives [Eb/Bb]free,
[Cm]That [Fm]the [Cm]earth shall [D]be [C]filled [Dm]with [Em]the [Fm]glory [Ab]of [Bbm]God
[Cm/Eb]As [Eb7/Db]the [Fm/C]waters [Eb/Bb]cover [Gdim]the [Fm]sea.

Verse 4:
[Fm]All we can do is nothing [Ab]worth
[Fm]Unless [Eb]God blesses [Fm/C]the [Eb]deed;
[Db/Ab]Vainly [Fm]we hope for the harvest tide
[Fm]Till [Cm/G]God [Ab]gives [Cm/G]life [Fm]to [Eb]teh [Fm/C]seed;
[Ab]Yet nearer [Cm]and nearer draws the [Eb]time,
[Cm]The [Bbm]time [Gdim]that [Fm]shall [Gdim]surely [Eb/Bb]be,
[Cm]When [Fm]the [Cm]earth shall [D]be [C]filled [Dm]with [Em]the [Fm]glory [Ab]of [Bbm]God
[Cm/Eb]As [Eb7/Db]the [Fm/C]waters [Eb/Bb]cover [Gdim]the [Fm]sea.
